A recovery email account should itself be protected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If a recovery account becomes compromised, it may create additional security risks for the main Gmail Account.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Using strong credentials and appropriate security controls on recovery accounts is therefore important.&lt;/p&gt;

