&lt;p&gt;Avoid predictable information such as names, birthdays, or simple number combinations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Avoid Password Reuse&lt;br&gt;
Using the same password on multiple services creates unnecessary risk.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If another website experiences a security incident, exposed credentials may be tested against other services.&lt;/p&gt;

